    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27504" root="ظأر" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُؤُورَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Inclination to,</i> or <i>affection for, the young
one of another:</i> (M, K:) it may be an inf. n.,
as well as a pl. [of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظِئْرٌ</span>]. (M.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also [The
<i>relation in which one stands by being a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظِئْر</span>, or
<i>nurse:</i>] like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُمُومَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُؤُولَةٌ</span> &amp;c. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظِئْرٌ</span>, latter half.

